api_contract:
POST /v1/plans/{plan_id}/entitlements/windows
Request JSON: { 'window_unit': 'daily|weekly|monthly', 'window_size': 1, 'allowance_units': 100000, 'priority_rules': [ { 'route': '/v1/generate', 'priority': 'high' }, ... ], 'deferred_credit': true }
Response: 201 { 'rule_id': 'we-1234', 'summary': 'Daily window 100k units with deferred_credit=true' }

GET /v1/billing/{customer_id}/windows/{window_start} - returns computed consumed, overage, provisional_credit, audit_record_id.

Admin simulation: POST /v1/admin/simulate-window - accepts sample usage and returns enforcement trace and credit estimate.
